<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Northstar is a personal decision journal for navigating life's choices with intention.">
  <title>Northstar | Find Your Way Forward</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/landing.css">
</head>

<body class="landing-page">

  <!-- NAVIGATION -->
  <header class="landing-nav">
    <a href="/" class="landing-logo">northstar ✳</a>

    <nav class="landing-nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="/login">Sign in</a>
      <a href="/signup" class="landing-nav-cta">Begin your journey</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>

    <!-- 01: POSSIBILITY -->
    <section class="landing-hero">

      <div class="landing-hero-content">
        <p class="landing-eyebrow">YOUR LIFE. YOUR DIRECTION.</p>

        <h1>Find your way <em>forward.</em></h1>

        <p class="landing-hero-description">
          Life comes with choices. Make space to explore yours, trust your thinking, and move forward with intention.
        </p>

        <a href="/signup" class="landing-primary-button">
          Start your decision journal
        </a>
      </div>

      <img
        class="landing-hero-image"
        src="/img/northstar-hero.jpg"
        alt="Four people standing together beneath an expansive blue sky">

    </section>

    <!-- 02: PAUSE -->
    <section class="landing-pause">

      <p class="landing-eyebrow">THE BEAUTY OF BECOMING</p>

      <h2>There is no one way<br>to live a life.</h2>

      <p>
        No single timeline. No perfect roadmap.
        Just a life full of possibilities, questions,
        and choices that are yours to make.
      </p>

    </section>

    <!-- 03: REFLECTION -->
    <section class="landing-reflection">

      <img
        src="/img/northstar-reflection.jpg"
        alt="A person sitting quietly in thought"
        loading="lazy">

      <div class="landing-reflection-content">
        <p class="landing-eyebrow">A MOMENT TO THINK</p>

        <h2>Some answers<br>take time.</h2>

        <p>
          Not every decision comes with certainty. Northstar gives you room to consider what matters, understand your options, and find clarity along the way.
        </p>
      </div>

    </section>

    <!-- 04: CLARITY -->
    <section class="landing-clarity">

      <p class="landing-eyebrow">INTRODUCING THE DECISION ROOM</p>

      <h2>A little more clarity.<br>One decision at a time.</h2>

      <p>
        A personal space to document your thoughts, organize life's decisions, and revisit your thinking as you grow.
      </p>

      <div class="landing-feature-grid">

        <article>
          <span>01 / DOCUMENT</span>
          <h3>Put your thoughts into words.</h3>
          <p>Capture the decisions you're navigating and what matters most.</p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>02 / ORGANIZE</span>
          <h3>See where you stand.</h3>
          <p>Keep track of the choices you're considering or have made.</p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>03 / REFLECT</span>
          <h3>Grow with your decisions.</h3>
          <p>Return to past entries and see how your perspective evolves.</p>
        </article>

      </div>

    </section>

    <!-- 05: YOUR NEXT CHAPTER -->
    <section class="landing-final-cta">

      <p class="landing-eyebrow">THE NEXT CHAPTER IS YOURS</p>

      <h2>What will you<br>make possible?</h2>

      <p>Every direction begins with a decision.</p>

      <a href="/signup" class="landing-final-button">
        Begin with Northstar
      </a>

    </section>

  </main>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer class="landing-footer">
    <a href="/" class="landing-logo">northstar ✳</a>
    <p>Make space for what matters.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>